keywords:
  - statistics
  - p-value aggregation
  - multiple testing
  - hypothesis testing
  - order statistics
  - truncated rank aggregation

abstract: >
  Python implementation of Truncated Rank Aggregation (TRA), a statistical
  method for combining the most informative ordered p-values. The package
  includes exact finite-sample null distributions, ordered-simplex validation,
  fast grid evaluation, and fixed-k asymptotic approximations.